text = "WASD / Arrows to move and crouch   |   Space to jump (buffered + coyote time)\nMove the player to blend idle -> walk -> run.\nJump/Fall/Land are one-shot states in the generated AnimationTree state machine.\nThe NPC on the right is a bone (skeletal) animation: its arm waves via a BoneClip.\nOpen the plugin dock: Project > Plugins > 2D Character Animator."
